  "description": "These floor mats are laser-measured for each make and model; designed to be a precise fit that grips the carpet and stays put. An aggressive-looking textured surface gives your muddy shoes plenty of traction and looks great inside the vehicle.\nFeatures\nMaximum Carpet Protection. Ridges and channels keep your feet above the muck and direct liquid to the raised perimeter that extends up the walls of the footwell and acts as a shallow pan to ensure no liquid runs over onto your carpet.\nAdvanced Measuring System and Computer Design. The floor on each vehicle is digitally mapped using 3D laser equipment to obtain precise dimensions, then the molds that form the floor mats are computer designed, ensuring a finished product that hugs the contours of the floor.\nTPE Construction. OEDRO floor mats are made of TPE. This material is strong and durable, yet flexible even in extreme cold, as well as non-toxic, fire-resistant, UV-resistant, environmentally friendly, and odorless, so your interior won’t take on an unpleasant smell.\nDurable material. TPE material is tough, durable, and easy to clean. Compared with traditional PVC, it has better abrasion resistance, heat resistance, and flexibility in hot/cold weather.\nNo sliding. OEDRO floor mats use snap styles, snap-in clips can prevent the car liner set from moving or blocking the pedals.\n2 years warranty. For your safety, professional installation is highly recommended\nFitment\nCompatible with 2015-2022 Chevy Colorado Crew Cab.\nCompatible with 2015-2022 GMC Canyon Crew Cab.",
